  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞把{F4 84 04 01 01 01 02 09}\n　交给了伊丽莎白。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E4 10}哎呀，真是美丽……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 11}谢谢您。\n我会好好珍藏的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:1:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2E 11}话说……您知道白金这种物质，\n是怎样来到这个世界上的吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}知道{F5 47 02 01 01 01 03 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}不知道{F5 47 02 01 01 01 05 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 36 11}哎呀，您真博学。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}又或者，是因为送女性礼物，\n才对此了解颇深……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:3:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 46 11}真是个罪孽深重的男人……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}据说，白金是由陨石带来的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}据说，\n这也是它与其他贵金属相比，\n只能从地球表面取得的原因。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……接下来是我的推测，\n那些陨石恐怕来自一颗\n名为“白金星”的未知行星吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:4:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}品尝白金星人的白金料理……\n用白金羊羹和白金茶度过午后……\n在白金旅馆里做着白金美梦……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:4:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 46 11}进行星际旅行时，\n真想顺道去看看。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E8 0E}那么，这是您的报酬。\n请收下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_530.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞收下了{F4 45 04 01 00 00 01 01}！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
